---
// Film 01 (v2): How an engagement actually runs.
// A 48 second, 8 scene storyboard film drawn entirely in SVG.
// Scene groups carry data-ss/data-se (start/end seconds); animated elements
// carry data-fx (effect) + data-s (start second) + optional data-d (duration).
// A single Web Animations API runner turns those into one synchronized loop.
---

<svg class="film-eng" viewBox="0 0 960 540" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img"
  aria-label="An animated film of how an engagement runs, from the RFP landing on a Friday evening to submission day">
